   * @setHeader token.access Authorization
   *
   * @param connection
   * @param body Refresh token for obtaining new access token.
   * @x-autobe-authorization-type refresh
   * @x-autobe-authorization-actor admin
   * @x-autobe-specification Refresh JWT access token using a valid refresh token. Validates the refresh token against active sessions in shopping_mall_admin_sessions table. Checks that the session has not expired (expired_at is in the future) and the administrator account is still active (deleted_at is null). Generates a new access token with updated expiration. Optionally rotates the refresh token by invalidating the old session and creating a new one. Returns new tokens in IShoppingMallAdmin.IAuthorized format. Used when access token expires but refresh token is still valid.
   * @nestia Generated by Nestia - https://github.com/samchon/nestia
   */
  @TypedRoute.Post("refresh")
  public async refresh(
    @TypedBody()
    body: IShoppingMallAdmin.IRefresh,
