   * Filter out soft-deleted records (deleted_at is null).
   * Return complete image record including id, image_url, display_order, created_at, updated_at.
   * Ensure proper authorization: public access for customers viewing products, seller access for managing own product images.
   * @nestia Generated by Nestia - https://github.com/samchon/nestia
